<title>ISRAEL: Delek Q2 EPS 3.65 shekels vs 2.84.</title>
<headline>Delek Q2 EPS 3.65 shekels vs 2.84.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delek the Israel Fuel Corp reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97	Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  1,026,709  966,988    2,039,588   1,975,156</p>
<p>Operating Profit	  53,958   51,715	102,113     103,058</p>
<p>Net Profit		  35,170   27,402	 78,932	57,933</p>
<p>EPS			     3.65     2.84	   8.19	  6.01</p>
<p>Note: The first half of 1997 results included a one-time gain of 14.5 million shekels recorded in the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company will pay an interim dividend of 1.25 shekels per share.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.52 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
